{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_49","type":"agent_message","text":"The sample diagnostics show a distributed, multi-megabase enrichment pattern rather than a classic narrow-peak profile, but they do not distinguish the three broad marks reliably. I’m adding an authoritative hg38 gene annotation and will measure signal around transcription start sites versus gene bodies in Galaxy; those positional profiles separate promoter H3K4me3, gene-body H3K36me3, and Polycomb/repeat-associated broad marks."}}
