{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_81","type":"agent_message","text":"The complete gene-context scan confirms promoter depletion (signal/control normalized ratio 0.626 at protein-coding promoters) and gene-body-core depletion (0.821), while the complete repeat scan shows 53.87% of signal reads in RepeatMasker sequence versus 46.29% of control (1.164×), with satellite 1.564× and LTR 1.384×. I’m adding a full-depth MACS2 broad call as an independent peak-topology check before finalizing between the two repressive broad-mark candidates."}}
